    <!-- ===== GUARDIAN SHIELD — "Violet Pro" LIGHT palette (v4-day, 2026-08-23)
         Reference-inspired redesign (user-approved: Content Blocker mock,
         BOTH light+dark, full parity rounds). This file = LIGHT (day) set;
         values-night/colors.xml = dark set. Same TOKEN NAMES on both sides so
         every screen flips automatically — no layout/code changes.

         Accent: indigo/violet #6C5CE7 (One-UI-playful but restrained).
         Semantics: green=active, red=blocked, amber=warning per reference.
         Light side uses SOFT SHADOWS (@dimen/card_elevation) instead of
         hairline strokes (card_stroke = transparent here). -->

